  offerLine: It's in the bush somewhere. It smells like the best day of my life. It's a truffle. I've never actually found one. Help me?
  activeLine: It's out there. Take me along, my nose will help. Probably.
  readyLine: THAT'S IT. That's the smell! Do you know what you could make with this? I do. Here. It's the only recipe I know.
  doneLine: Now cook it! Please! For me!
